<node id="Moderate Risk Profile">
  <data key="d0">Moderate Risk Profile</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Moderate Risk Profile describes a range of risk preferences that influence investment strategies, as seen in clients' descriptions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Moderate Risk Profile indicates the Client's risk appetite and comfort with potential investment drawdowns.</data>
