  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Lisa Smith is a high-net-worth client with inheritance as her primary source of wealth, focusing on liquidity event planning with a 20-year horizon.&lt;SEP&gt;Lisa Smith is a high-net-worth (HNW) individual with a source of wealth from inheritance, currently residing in the US and originally from India.&lt;SEP&gt;Lisa Smith is a high-net-worth (HNW) client with a moderate risk profile, primarily focused on philanthropy.&lt;SEP&gt;Lisa Smith is a high-net-worth individual (HNW) with a moderate risk profile focusing on philanthropy and has recurring meetings related to her financial portfolio.&lt;SEP&gt;Lisa Smith is a client with a high-net-worth status, primarily acquiring wealth through inheritance, and has a balanced risk profile with moderate liquidity needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Lisa Smith is a high-net-worth individual (HNW) with a moderate risk profile, focusing on philanthropy in her meetings.&lt;SEP&gt;Lisa Smith is a high-net-worth client whose primary focus is on philanthropy and has a moderate risk profile.</data>
