<node id="Retirement">
  <data key="d0">Retirement</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Retirement is a significant financial goal for various individuals reflecting their focus on future planning and preparation for life after employment. Amanda Dudley prioritizes retirement planning, initially set with a one-year horizon, which indicates her urgency in addressing this goal. Similarly, Diana Foster also considers retirement her primary financial objective, aiming to achieve it within six years while maintaining a strong focus on future planning.

John Leblanc shares this emphasis on retirement, targeting a five-year horizon for his preparations, indicating a relatively short-term goal. Tasha Valencia likewise lists retirement as her primary goal, underscoring her commitment to effective planning for this phase of her life. Kenneth Fowler takes a longer-term approach, setting a 16-year investment horizon for his retirement goals, showcasing a strategic perspective on saving and investment. Joseph Brennan adopts a four-year focus, suggesting a more immediate timeframe for achieving his retirement objectives.

Additionally, retirement is recognized as a primary financial aim in the client profile of Daniel Burton, as well as for Jerry Robinson, who associates his retirement goal with a ten-year planning horizon and a specific target amount in Swiss Francs (CHF). This broad overview illustrates that retirement is a critical focus for a diverse group of individuals, each with varying timelines and financial strategies for achieving their retirement goals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-507a278edb4d7f298af4207a6e08b684&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f723ffbccecb34992a6a87bb2b36a6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf3a39730436dcc1ff5f88546ee6ec31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78590a72d74277e9dc00ea645e49dd4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f592f8877cf3a614f37bf40d342e4d9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6033da47eeed141f565ccaf6666ff5d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9acc7bde2d41aa78d03683e35f82a31b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf9f9be1887f63fcbf20e27457349539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68864a6863ae1eb43b1c2836c44420b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec207adcc92904fc5ccf953211c958f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f8cf3161ed849b6a80bfe0226ac8393</data>
