<node id="Bridgewater Macro">
  <data key="d0">Bridgewater Macro</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Bridgewater Macro is a distinguished global hedge fund known for its substantial market presence and diverse investment strategies. The fund boasts a reported market value of approximately £1,915,926,040, with significant valuations across various currencies, including €2,871,185.50, CHF 844,207.41, and AED 2,090,702.87. This broad appeal is further emphasized by its inclusion in the investment portfolios of numerous high-net-worth individuals (HNWIs) around the globe. Notable clients such as Jeremy Johnson and Leslie Adams, with respective investments of around SGD 13,531,841.53 and £719,859.81, alongside Andrea Williams, who holds a stake valued at £308,048.43, highlight the trust and investment confidence placed in Bridgewater Macro.

The hedge fund also holds a market value of 2090702.87 AED and has assets totaling 402,338.68 EUR. Bridgewater Macro is part of the financial strategies of clients like Yvette Huff, Melanie Munoz, Lindsay Blair, Noah Carter, and Anna Baker. The fund serves as a key holding in the portfolios of these clients, reinforcing its reputation as a sophisticated choice for those seeking substantial returns through diversified strategies. Notably, Christopher Davis holds Bridgewater Macro in his portfolio with a valuation of €2,871,185.50, while Jessica Nunez lists it with a market value of £1,915,926.04.

Additionally, Bridgewater Macro is recognized internationally, with varying market values reported, including 98,321.28 GBP, 591,548.58 USD, and 2,679,817.71 USD across its investments. The presence of this hedge fund in the financial portfolios of clients such as Susan Rogers, Nathan Arroyo, and an unspecified client valued at US$929,694.04 emphasizes its significance in global wealth management. Overall, Bridgewater Macro stands out as a pivotal player in the hedge fund sector, characterized by its extensive market reach, significant client trust, and strategic importance to investors seeking exposure to global markets.</data>
