<node id="Education">
  <data key="d0">Education</data>
  <data key="d1">goal</data>
  <data key="d2">Education is highlighted as the primary goal for Lindsay Blair, reflecting her priorities regarding financial investments for educational purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Education is a primary goal for Yvette Huff, with a target amount to be achieved in 18 years.&lt;SEP&gt;Education is a primary goal discussed by John Caldwell concerning his investment strategy for a 16-year horizon.&lt;SEP&gt;Education is a financial goal discussed by Lindsay Blair, focusing on funding education over an 11-year horizon.&lt;SEP&gt;Education is a financial goal related to funding educational expenses, particularly for family members.&lt;SEP&gt;Education is outlined as the primary goal for Yvette Huff, indicating support for educational pursuits.&lt;SEP&gt;Education is identified as the primary financial goal for the Client over an 18-year horizon.</data>
