<node id="Business Succession">
  <data key="d0">Business Succession</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Business Succession is a primary goal discussed by Jeffery Wagner, focusing on strategies for transferring executive wealth over a specific period of 9 years.&lt;SEP&gt;Business succession is a financial goal for Joseph Zuniga, indicating his plans for managing his business legacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Business Succession is a financial goal involving planning for the transfer of ownership and management of a business after an owner is no longer able to do so.&lt;SEP&gt;Business succession is the primary goal of Michelle Ray, revealing her focus for future planning.&lt;SEP&gt;Business succession is the primary goal of Chad Welch, associated with a 13-year planning horizon and a target amount in CHF.&lt;SEP&gt;Business Succession is a goal discussed by Jeremy Whitehead, involving planning for the transition of business ownership.&lt;SEP&gt;Business Succession refers to the plans and strategies by which ownership of a business is passed on to others, discussed by Jeffery Wagner.</data>
